{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【15：53更新】今早（17日）11時許，警方接獲深水埗富昌邨富韻樓保安報案，指發現有龜隻疑從高處墮下。警員接報到場，發現龜隻已明顯死亡。警員到場調查，於大廈樓層尋獲男飼主，他涉嫌殘酷對待動物被捕。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:23:58.919908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:44:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:37.623380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:32.074984+00:00","content_hash":"8bfa94227084fe577f71c85570d6ca9a103d30a752937563bfa53afd0767c91e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}